# Progress log

- **Read** `docs/PROGRESS.md` (Current stage + Next up) before non-trivial work.
  For history, read the newest files in `docs/progress/`.
- **Write** after a meaningful chunk:
  1. Refresh **Current stage** / **Next up** in `docs/PROGRESS.md`.
  2. Add a **new file** `docs/progress/YYYY-MM-DD-<slug>.md` starting with an
     `# YYYY-MM-DD — Title` heading.
- **One file per entry.** Never append to an existing entry and never edit an old
  one — the single-file log conflicted on every parallel change, which is why it
  was split (ADR-0007).
- Do not treat plan files as stage SSOT.
